{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts in Teignbridge","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"In Teignbridge:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"2.7","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Teignbridge was below the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"61%","note":"","content":"<p>In Devon, a higher proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"69%","note":"","content":"<p>A higher proportion of health and social care job adverts in Devon could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were 